Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Makes the classic right-click menu the default on Windows 11 (current user), so
; "Edit with Cropwell" shows without choosing "Show more options".
; Equivalent to: reg add "HKCU\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}\InprocServer32" /f /ve
; Restart Explorer or sign out for it to take effect.
; To undo: reg delete "HKCU\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}" /f

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}\InprocServer32]
@=""
